{"about_the_game":"A fun game involving colors and your memory.<br />\r\nIn Color Guardian, you must memorize a sequence of colors that will be shown and make the highest score possible.<br />\r\nYou can challenge some family / friend to compete with you, and see who can get the highest score.<br />\r\nThe challenge is not so great at the beginning of the game, but I doubt that you will be able to go from level 20 upwards.<br />\r\nHow about a little brain training with a fun memory and color challenge?<br />\r\nDecorate, hit and win!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/937130?t=1728354422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1728354422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728354422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1728354422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"A fun game involving colors and your memory.<br />\r\nIn Color Guardian, you must memorize a sequence of colors that will be shown and make the highest score possible.<br />\r\nYou can challenge some family / friend to compete with you, and see who can get the highest score.<br />\r\nThe challenge is not so great at the beginning of the game, but I doubt that you will be able to go from level 20 upwards.<br />\r\nHow about a little brain training with a fun memory and color challenge?<br />\r\nDecorate, hit and win!","developers":["Softwaves Mini"],"dlc":[938530],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"h